# To fetch real movie posters instead of placeholder text, you can get a free API Key from TMDB (The Movie Database).
# 1. Create a free account at https://www.themoviedb.org/
# 2. Go to Settings -> API -> Request an API Key
# 3. Rename this file to `.env` and paste your key below

TMDB_API_KEY=your_api_key_here
